      "text" : "我来帮您搜索猫粮相关的商品。您好！我是宠物商城AI助理小黄🐾，为您找到了多种猫粮商品，涵盖了不同价位和功能需求：\n\n<p class=\"product-recommend-title\">为您推荐以下猫粮商品：</p>\n<div class=\"product-card-list\">\n  <div class=\"product-card\" data-id=\"1\">\n    <div class=\"pc-img-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"/api/images/goods/goods_1_20260309153549_2349.jpg\" alt=\"猫粮营养成猫幼猫大袋装10斤成年猫鲜肉营养猫主粮饲料流浪猫20斤\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pc-info\">\n      <div class=\"pc-name\">猫粮营养成猫幼猫大袋装10斤成年猫鲜肉营养猫主粮饲料流浪猫20斤</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-tag-row\">\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">猫用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">热销</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">大袋装经济实惠，成猫幼猫通用型营养猫粮</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>9.66</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-card\" data-id=\"2\">\n    <div class=\"pc-img-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"/api/images/goods/goods_1_20260309153930_7586.jpg\" alt=\"便宜优惠试吃装通用型猫粮营养美味增肥猫主粮半斤1斤5斤特价散装\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pc-info\">\n      <div class=\"pc-name\">便宜优惠试吃装通用型猫粮营养美味增肥猫主粮半斤1斤5斤特价散装</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-tag-row\">\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">猫用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">特价</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">试吃装选择多样，适合初次尝试或小包装需求</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>3.88</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-card\" data-id=\"3\">\n    <div class=\"pc-img-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"/api/images/goods/goods_1_20260309153855_8763.png\" alt=\"冻干猫粮高蛋白5斤3斤试吃小颗粒幼猫全阶段大颗粒增肥发腮成猫\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pc-info\">\n      <div class=\"pc-name\">冻干猫粮高蛋白5斤3斤试吃小颗粒幼猫全阶段大颗粒增肥发腮成猫</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-tag-row\">\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">猫用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">冻干</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">热销</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">高蛋白冻干猫粮，适合增肥发腮，全阶段适用</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>4.90</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-card\" data-id=\"13\">\n    <div class=\"pc-img-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"/api/images/goods/mock_good.jpg\" alt=\"渴望六种鱼猫粮5.4kg成猫美毛全价粮\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pc-info\">\n      <div class=\"pc-name\">渴望六种鱼猫粮5.4kg成猫美毛全价粮</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-tag-row\">\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">猫用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">高端</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">美毛</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">六种鱼深海营养，美毛护肤，成猫专用</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>799.00</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-card\" data-id=\"14\">\n    <div class=\"pc-img-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"/api/images/goods/mock_good.jpg\" alt=\"皇家K36幼猫粮2kg哺乳期猫咪专用粮\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pc-info\">\n      <div class=\"pc-name\">皇家K36幼猫粮2kg哺乳期猫咪专用粮</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-tag-row\">\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">猫用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">幼猫</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">热销</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">幼猫专属，助力生长发育，哺乳期母猫适用</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>119.00</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-card\" data-id=\"17\">\n    <div class=\"pc-img-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"/api/images/goods/mock_good.jpg\" alt=\"网易严选全价猫粮2kg成猫增肥发腮粮\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pc-info\">\n      <div class=\"pc-name\">网易严选全价猫粮2kg成猫增肥发腮粮</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-tag-row\">\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">猫用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">增肥</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">热销</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">高肉含量，助猫咪增肥发腮，营养均衡</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>88.00</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n## 选购建议\n\n**根据您的需求，我可以为您推荐：**\n\n### 按预算选择\n- **经济实惠型**：商品1、2、5、6（价格在¥3.88-¥12.23）\n- **中端品质型**：商品14、15、17（价格在¥88-¥119）\n- **高端进口型**：商品13、16（价格在¥529-¥799）\n\n### 按功能需求\n- **幼猫专用**：皇家K36幼猫粮（商品14）\n- **美毛护肤**：渴望六种鱼猫粮（商品13）\n- **增肥发腮**：网易严选全价猫粮（商品17）\n- **肠胃敏感**：卫仕无谷猫粮（商品15）\n- **试吃体验**：商品2、3的试吃装\n\n### 按包装规格\n- **小包装试吃**：商品2、3、5\n- **中等包装**：商品14、15、17（1.8kg-2kg）\n- **大包装经济**：商品1、4、6、7（5斤-40斤）\n\n您可以根据猫咪的年龄、健康状况和预算来选择合适的猫粮。如果需要更具体的推荐，请告诉我您的猫咪情况（如年龄、品种、是否有特殊需求等）！🐱"
